{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0341_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0341_story_02_title", "source_sha256": "a5d2ced997fa8962349496edf390c29b9f48529401b0d661d6db3df817b308ec", "ja": "私たちも『アイドル』だからこそ", "zh": "正因为我们也是“偶像”", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0341_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0341_story_02_synopsis", "source_sha256": "eb11da4f73617ec9775f88c95a5264fbf06e1bb482b1ccfd2815c61dca8d6cdc", "ja": "第三幕のメンバーは昴、紗代子、亜利沙\n千鶴、可憐。冒頭の読み合わせを終え、\n今後の方針を話し合う。ヒリつくような\nライバル関係を目指すことに決まり、\n全員気合いを入れて挑むと意気込む。", "zh": "第三幕的成员有昴、紗代子、亚利沙、千鹤和可怜。结束开头部分的合读后，大家商讨了今后的方针。最终决定以令人紧张的对手关系为目标，所有人都干劲十足地准备迎接挑战。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0341_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0341_story_02_1000_p", "source_sha256": "26e47a3440f84c37460145fcbab2b39359b6ee25284565b09218094105a8dd9e", "ja": "（『STARDOM ROAD』第三幕の稽古がスタート。\n今は、冒頭の読み合わせを終えたところだ）", "zh": "（《STARDOM ROAD》第三幕的排练开始了。\n现在刚结束开头部分的对词）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0341_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0341_story_02_1001_047sub", "source_sha256": "e9ed5f93bfe6195ea77085e96afd5aaa8f6dc0b5faf358d1aa7fbb2bdbeb67ea", "ja": "えっと……とりあえず最初だけやってみたけど、\nこんな感じでいいのかな～？", "zh": "那个……总之先试着演了一下开头，这样应该可以吧～？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0341_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0341_story_02_1002_027say", "source_sha256": "5b522f8556471610731d7b9ba9b4d4b7982c0707f0b8648af33997a23c0603a0", "ja": "悪くないと思う！\n雰囲気は掴めてるんじゃないかな？", "zh": "我觉得还不错！\n应该已经抓到那种感觉了吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0341_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0341_story_02_1003_028ari", "source_sha256": "ed64baf95748b01fd665b9c2623fe55b4bcf68435d91b275579ce038a66168ec", "ja": "みんなで第一幕と第二幕を、穴が開くほど\n鑑賞した甲斐がありましたね！　ムフフ……♪", "zh": "大家一起把第一幕和第二幕\n看到快要看穿的努力没有白费呢！唔呼呼……♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0341_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0341_story_02_1004_047sub", "source_sha256": "2cae9b379e37d80f7610409f8b207923475263b2b5e989863f8595db989b98f9", "ja": "そっか！　なら、オレの真珠星は\n最後までこんな感じでいくぜ！", "zh": "这样啊！那我的珍珠星就要一直保持这个样子到最后咯！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0341_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0341_story_02_1005_045kar", "source_sha256": "3055e07e39d648e006de4b30a2153a4d690ffca3879aa35ebd87d498e2d09206", "ja": "最後まで、この感じで……。\n……い、いいのかな……？", "zh": "到最后，就这种感觉……。\n……这、这样真的可以吗……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0341_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0341_story_02_1006_038chz", "source_sha256": "0207418e9c77cd8051f93b4036ca0e67a9c2fa4252cce2ddcadf32708a0b69be", "ja": "？\n可憐、どうかしまして？", "zh": "？\n可怜，怎么了吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0341_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0341_story_02_1007_045kar", "source_sha256": "48067a4fb2b7c99d560135412f87723095b07711a81f9ddde8aa815a4972173e", "ja": "あ！　え、えっと……。", "zh": "啊！那、那个……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0341_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0341_story_02_1008_p", "source_sha256": "bb86a84312474a7602884898e6ccdb49f7e3f69c8fb771499fb9cf8221b2d5ab", "ja": "可憐。何か気になる事があるなら、\n遠慮しないで言ってみてくれ。", "zh": "可怜。要是有什么在意的事，\n不用客气，尽管说出来吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0341_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0341_story_02_1009_045kar", "source_sha256": "5bc45301886b4baf28192577a25aca88a850a97a04c88f187cf80f9d92e488af", "ja": "は、はい……。あの、気になる、っていうか……。\nお話が進むと、人物の関係が、か、変わるので……。", "zh": "是、是的……那个，与其说是在意……不如说……随着故事发展，人物之间的关系会、会发生变化……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0341_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0341_story_02_1010_045kar", "source_sha256": "c522ca72207389bfd5bed416c06c74090d321d1927a936a02e6f546e0a1ee611", "ja": "もっと、嫌な雰囲気……ふ、不安とか、\n必死さとかも、あると……いいのかなって……。", "zh": "要是能更有那种、讨厌的氛围……比、比如不安感，\n还有拼命挣扎的感觉……会不会更好呢……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0341_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0341_story_02_1011_028ari", "source_sha256": "af3c61c9029a0868433aa07e51489aaf768d8afcd84c0fcef406f1754c67f762", "ja": "なるほど……。確かに三幕の内容は、\n『新生I.V.』メンバー入りをかけたお話ですしね。", "zh": "原来如此……确实，第三幕的内容是围绕争夺加入『新生I.V.』成员资格展开的故事呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0341_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0341_story_02_1012_038chz", "source_sha256": "bb7cc47f22ce176af1e92eb6ba924d566c7eb53db18f3af923fa4c5cade6c458", "ja": "そうですわね……わたくしも、同意見ですわ。\nどうでしょう？　{$P$}。", "zh": "是这样呢……我也同意这个意见。您觉得怎么样？{$P$}。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0341_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0341_story_02_1013_038chz", "source_sha256": "5da4de699d7edf2db148c6781d0a4a393990ca3a457d86df5e66cbe00d6a394a", "ja": "人物像を掘り下げる事に、時間をかけてみませんか？\nチャレンジする価値があると思いますわ。", "zh": "要不要花点时间深入挖掘人物形象呢？\n我认为这是值得尝试的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0341_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0341_story_02_1014_p", "source_sha256": "d0e7c0c78546d12ac4f4c3e7167b6941c9627669442c3441c7b86bf9e3995b2f", "ja": "そうですね。人物への理解は、物語への理解へと\n繋がります。ここで時間を取るのはアリかと。", "zh": "是啊。对人物的理解，会进一步加深对故事的理解。在这里花点时间，我觉得也未尝不可。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0341_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0341_story_02_1015_p", "source_sha256": "5d032dfee430c416a8fd2f3e800e9a78489075d48bff44d76e0411f977692a3f", "ja": "どうだろう、みんな。まだ時間はあるし、\n試行錯誤してみないか？", "zh": "大家觉得怎么样？时间还充裕，要不要试着多摸索一下？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0341_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0341_story_02_1016_047sub", "source_sha256": "c10ff31adab432a47b8f9afef375ffffeaf1eb21e689b644cb279c78ed6e5f12", "ja": "……そういえば、星梨花も根性入れて\nレッスンしてたみたいだよな……。", "zh": "……说起来，星梨花好像也在拼命练习来着……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0341_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0341_story_02_1017_027say", "source_sha256": "08664c8ca3bbcf49e390387a835acc5cd1b640948869f957cdd6cb3b048af9b7", "ja": "まつりさんも朋花ちゃんも、\n気迫が画面から伝わってくるくらいだった……。", "zh": "茉莉小姐和朋花的气势，\n简直都要透过屏幕传过来了……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0341_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0341_story_02_1018_027say", "source_sha256": "9cb28bdf109763ab91c9a63fb244d19da4c6a9b53e75548a9c1537a423b5050c", "ja": "私、賛成です！　見てくれた人が\nピリっとするくらい、気迫を込めたいです！", "zh": "我赞成！我也想让看的人\n感受到那种令人一振的气势！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0341_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0341_story_02_1019_027say", "source_sha256": "baaadaf72f249638470f7d9963e667cd12a8b191ccd248d55eab0341c710bdb3", "ja": "アイドル同士、ライバルなのは私達も一緒ですから！\nバチバチしたヒリつく関係、目指してみます！", "zh": "偶像之间是竞争对手，我们也是一样的！\n我会试着以彼此针锋相对、剑拔弩张的关系为目标！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0341_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0341_story_02_1020_028ari", "source_sha256": "b8a35bfa2eb371e3108fa7698bc4255b6af5f56110bd2005853d7fd1cf65ad90", "ja": "アイドルちゃん同士で、ヒリつくような……！\n……。", "zh": "偶像们之间也要有那种针锋相对的感觉……！\n……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0341_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0341_story_02_1021_p", "source_sha256": "fb0bdea40fa4684a12be10ce19eea915af8ee675ebca6104d47cdeb98acc6e6e", "ja": "アイドルという題材だからこそ、だな。\nせっかくのいい機会だと捉えてほしい。", "zh": "正因为是偶像这个主题，才会这样。\n希望你能把这当成一次难得的好机会。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0341_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0341_story_02_1022_p", "source_sha256": "80c94e5b8493f8708a772cae6039dc018f3d8f8a1705135c6c0e224c259df1e2", "ja": "不安があるなら、メンバーや俺を頼ってくれて\n構わない。まずは各々考えながらやってみよう！", "zh": "如果感到不安，尽管依靠成员们和我。先一边各自思考，一边试着做做看吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0341_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0341_story_02_1023_047sub", "source_sha256": "b5b20dbf03c04583c34840757f14deaaf5b7b782796ba7738947d3d5e6d6cf8f", "ja": "おう！", "zh": "哦！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0341_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0341_story_02_1024_027say", "source_sha256": "c8437da922b05a66a006272ae646cc70f57e96453c9e5b620e3abbd8e90368f7", "ja": "はい！", "zh": "好的！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0341_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0341_story_02_1025_028ari", "source_sha256": "c846907f6e809be065a8040f4e294abb10d15f88906f68b1ee26ab1e0fa3c3b0", "ja": "わ、わかりました！", "zh": "我、我明白了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0341_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0341_story_02_1026_045kar", "source_sha256": "f716e6a984c7427439d4f1b47c5cc82dffa9d7b0a09270a7fe6f2e20ef9496d5", "ja": "は、はい……！", "zh": "好、好的……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0341_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0341_story_02_1027_038chz", "source_sha256": "2df36b34dd6bcf9447ba44fd19651899046ba39c1d862a1ce50616abc6f726a3", "ja": "ええ！", "zh": "好的！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
